{"product_id":"what-happens-now","title":"What Happens Now","description":"\u003cp\u003eProduct Description      Winter, 1981, and fifteen-year-old Alistair Black is wrestling with the fierce power of his imagination. The boundaries between what is real and what is fantasy are dissolving to increasingly dangerous effect. And then he falls in love with Alice . . .WHAT HAPPENS NOW is a mesmerizing story about love, fear and faith. Atmospheric, suspenseful and spiked with black humour, it confirms Jeremy Dyson as one of the most exciting and original writers of his generation.      About the Author      Jeremy Dyson was born and raised in Leeds. He is the author of the highly acclaimed short story collection NEVER TRUST A RABBIT and co-writer of the Bafta award-winning TV series THE LEAGUE OF GENTLEMEN. He lives in London.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 126 x 196\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jeremy Dyson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780349118154\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45748947452057,"sku":"16RB-4-9780349118154","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d6316bedd0b_What_Happens_Now_Jeremy_Dyson.jpg?v=1758895152","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/what-happens-now","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}